for equipment, livestock, farmland, and crop production; homeowners, fixed life, auto, boat, renters, condo, ATV, motorcycle, and business insurance; liquidity management; and digital banking, mobile deposit, e-statements, and e-alerts services. Colony Bankcorp, Inc. was founded in 1975 and is headquartered in Fitzgerald, Georgia."}}